      "rationale": "החשמל (hashmal) daɲɛ gɛlɛn don: sanan-wɛlɛ min ɲɛ bɛ ci (elekitorɔmu), kɛrɛ len-wɛlɛ, walima len-wɛlɛ min bɛ yeelen ci — bayɛlɛmabaga bɛɛ tɛ o fɔ cogo kelen."
